{"id":"659088","name":"鹿茸菇老鸭汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659088/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"老鸭","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鹿茸菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"老鸭冷水下锅焯烫后洗净备用。","img":"images/659088/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸭肉放入珐琅锅里，加入姜片。","img":"images/659088/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/659088/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大火煮开转小火煲30分钟。","img":"images/659088/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鹿茸菇清水清洗一下。","img":"images/659088/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分钟后把鹿茸菇放入老鸭汤里。","img":"images/659088/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"继续小火煲30分钟。","img":"images/659088/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"出锅前再少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/659088/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659088/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659088/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659088/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}